---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Notice" 
  description="How Cyber Scotland Connect handles your data across our meetups, platforms, and community spaces."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] pb-8 mb-12 transition-colors">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#56548c] dark:text-[#6fb7e6] block mb-1">
        Transparency & Governance
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight transition-colors">
        Privacy Notice
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf] text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl transition-colors">
        This notice explains what personal information Cyber Scotland Connect (CSC) collects, how we use it, and your statutory rights under UK GDPR.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Card -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#2a2948] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66] p-8 sm:p-10 space-y-8 shadow-sm transition-colors text-slate-700 dark:text-[#d3c7e3] text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
          1. What Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use event platforms (such as Meetup.com and Eventbrite) to organise our community gatherings. When you register for a CSC event, we receive limited information necessary to manage attendance:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">
          <li>Your display name</li>
          <li>Your registered city/location</li>
          <li>Your platform user identifier</li>
          <li>Any dietary, accessibility, or question responses voluntarily submitted during RSVP</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
          2. Purpose & Legal Basis for Processing
        </h2>
        <p>
          We process this information under the legal basis of <strong>legitimate interest</strong>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">
          <li>To manage venue capacity, fire safety, and badge check-ins at physical events.</li>
          <li>To measure community attendance patterns and report aggregate, anonymised metrics to grassroots supporters and venues.</li>
          <li>To send essential event reminders and updates via the platform you used to RSVP.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data with commercial sponsors or vendors. All CSC events are zero-sales environments.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
          3. Data Retention
        </h2>
        <p>
          We periodically download attendee rosters from event platforms for historical reporting and venue verification. Event attendance records are retained securely for administrative purposes and deleted when no longer required.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
          4. Your Statutory Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under UK data protection legislation, you have specific rights regarding your personal information:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#21203a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs uppercase mb-1">Right of Access</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">You can request copies of the personal data we hold about you.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#21203a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs uppercase mb-1">Right to Rectification</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">You can ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#21203a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs uppercase mb-1">Right to Erasure</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">You can request deletion of your information from our local event records.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#21203a] border border-slate-200 dark:border-[#3e3c66]">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs uppercase mb-1">Right to Object</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#bdaccf]">You have the right to object to processing based on legitimate interest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wide">
          5. Contact & Questions
        </h2>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights or ask questions about how we handle community data, contact the moderation team at:
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@cyberscotlandconnect.com" class="text-[#895294] dark:text-[#6fb7e6] font-semibold hover:underline">
            hello@cyberscotlandconnect.com
          </a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#8c89b0]">
          For independent guidance on your data privacy rights, visit the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/your-data-matters/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white">UK Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) ↗</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
